Insular Enhanced

This distribution is based on Insular:
https://gitlab.com/secure-system/Insular

Insular is itself based on Island:
https://github.com/oasisfeng/island

Insular also credits Shelter as an inspiration:
https://github.com/PeterCxy/Shelter

This distribution contains community modifications for permission guidance,
clone and installer reliability, cross-profile app launching, diagnostic logs,
and direct installation of standalone APK files into the managed profile.

Insular Enhanced is an unofficial community fork and is not endorsed by or
affiliated with the upstream projects, F-Droid, Google, Xiaomi, or other device
manufacturers.

